No, I just checked it out in the eat.c source module

Stone resistance is not an intrinsic.

When you first eat a corpse the code checks if it is a lizard or an acidic
corpse.  If it is, then it checks to see if you just got stoned.  If so, then
it un-stones you.  This is a one-shot deal that happens as soon as you bite
into the corpse.

New intrinsics are not granted until you completely finish the corpse.  Stone
resistance is not checked for in this code.
